@startuml
title Student Feature — Class Diagram (Plan)
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Session <<Foundation>> {
  id: UUID
  activityCode: string
  currentRoundId: UUID?
  stateVersion: integer
}
class Team <<Foundation>> {
  id: UUID
  sessionId: UUID
  name: string
}
class Participant <<Foundation>> {
  id: UUID
  teamId: UUID
  displayName: string?
}
class Round <<Foundation>> {
  id: UUID
  sessionId: UUID
  phase: Waiting | Active | Ended
  target: Question XOR QuestionGroup
}
class Question <<Foundation>>
class Blank <<Foundation>>
class QuestionGroup <<Foundation>>
class Submission <<Foundation>> {
  id: UUID
  teamId: UUID
  roundId: UUID
  acceptedOrder: integer
}
class SubmissionAnswer <<Foundation>>
class Result <<Foundation>> {
  roundId: UUID
  winningSubmissionId: UUID
}
class ActorContext <<Foundation>> {
  actorKind: teacher | participant
  actorId: string
  sessionId: UUID?
  teamId: UUID?
  permissions: string[]
}

class StudentTrustedEndCoordinator <<Student service proposal>> {
  endRound(input, actorContext): SessionStateSnapshot
}
interface FoundationEndLifecyclePort <<Foundation internal port proposal>> {
  endRoundWithWinnerResolver(input, resolver): SessionStateSnapshot
}
interface WinnerResolver <<callback contract proposal>> {
  resolve(roundId): Result | null
}

class StudentBrowserCredential <<Student>> {
  id: UUID
  tokenHash: digest
  expiresAt: datetime
  revokedAt: datetime?
}
class StudentBrowserParticipant <<Student>> {
  credentialId: UUID
  sessionId: UUID
  participantId: UUID
}
class TeamLeader <<Student>> {
  teamId: UUID
  participantId: UUID
  assignedAt: datetime
}
class TeamRoundDraft <<Student>> {
  teamId: UUID
  roundId: UUID
  version: integer
  status: editable | locked
  lockedAt: datetime?
}
class TeamRoundDraftAnswer <<Student>> {
  teamId: UUID
  roundId: UUID
  blankId: UUID
  value: string
  revision: integer
}
class DraftMutationReceipt <<Student persistence>> {
  teamId
  roundId
  clientMutationId
  requestFingerprint
  committedChange
}
TeamRoundDraft "1" *-- "0..*" DraftMutationReceipt : idempotent retries

class StudentResultView <<DTO>> {
  roundId: UUID
  winner: WinningTeamView?
}
class WinningTeamView <<DTO>> {
  teamId: UUID
  teamName: string
  answers: WinningAnswer[]
}

Session "1" -- "0..*" Team : contains
Session "1" -- "0..*" Round : attempts
Round "0..*" --> "0..1" Question : targets one
Round "0..*" --> "0..1" QuestionGroup : targets one
Question "1" -- "0..*" Blank : contains
QuestionGroup "1" -- "0..*" Question : groups
Team "1" -- "0..*" Participant : membership
Team "1" -- "0..1" TeamLeader : current leader
Participant "1" -- "0..1" TeamLeader : assigned leader
StudentBrowserCredential "1" -- "0..*" StudentBrowserParticipant : restores
Session "1" -- "0..*" StudentBrowserParticipant : scopes
Participant "1" -- "0..1" StudentBrowserParticipant : recovered as
Team "1" -- "0..*" TeamRoundDraft : owns
Round "1" -- "0..*" TeamRoundDraft : scopes
TeamRoundDraft "1" *-- "0..*" TeamRoundDraftAnswer : contains
Blank "1" -- "0..*" TeamRoundDraftAnswer : current value
Team "1" -- "0..*" Submission : submits
Round "1" -- "0..*" Submission : accepts
Submission "1" *-- "1..*" SubmissionAnswer : contains
Blank "1" -- "0..*" SubmissionAnswer : answered by
Round "1" -- "0..1" Result : publishes
Submission "1" <-- "0..1" Result : winning submission
Submission "1" ..> StudentResultView : projected only after Ended

note right of TeamLeader
At most one row per Team.
First successful enrollment inserts it atomically.
The leader Participant must belong to that Team.
After first Active, new Participants may join only an existing Team;
they do not replace its leader. Existing Participants cannot transfer Teams.
end note

note bottom of TeamRoundDraft
Unique (teamId, roundId).
Every accepted edit increments version.
Successful Submission locks this row in the same transaction.
end note

note bottom of Submission
Existing Foundation constraints remain authoritative:
UNIQUE(teamId, roundId), UNIQUE(roundId, acceptedOrder).
Student assigns acceptedOrder server-side under BEGIN IMMEDIATE.
end note

note left of StudentBrowserCredential
Student-specific HttpOnly cookie contains only a high-entropy opaque secret;
Path=/ sends it to Student HTTP and same-origin /socket.io.
Database stores its digest, expiry and revocation state.
Session mapping selects the canonical Participant;
no client-provided identity is trusted.
end note

note right of QuestionGroup
An empty group may be stored as incomplete data,
but cannot be a Round target.
end note

note right of StudentResultView
Returns winning Team name and its successful answer values,
or winner=null. No losing submissions or acceptedOrder.
Foundation ResultView is not expanded.
end note

StudentTrustedEndCoordinator ..> FoundationEndLifecyclePort : one internal End call
FoundationEndLifecyclePort ..> WinnerResolver : invoke within same write transaction
StudentTrustedEndCoordinator ..> ActorContext : proposed round:end capability
TeamLeader ..> ActorContext : proposed team:leader:transfer capability

note bottom of FoundationEndLifecyclePort
Coordinator, transaction port and WinnerResolver return synchronously;
the callback receives Foundation's same SQLite connection/transaction.
Foundation does not import Student. Commit precedes async Socket.IO dispatch;
notification work is never awaited inside the transaction.
The capability strings are proposals, not existing Foundation grants.
end note
@enduml
